"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs=self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs||[]).push([[1173],{8529(e,t,r){r.r(t),r.d(t,{comp:()=>s,data:()=>o});var a=r(20641);const n={},s=(0,r(66262).A)(n,[["render",function(e,t){return(0,a.uX)(),(0,a.CE)("div",null,t[0]||(t[0]=[(0,a.Fv)('<h1 id="product-barcodes-generation-printing" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#product-barcodes-generation-printing"><span>Product Barcodes: Generation &amp; Printing</span></a></h1><p>In modern retail and warehouse fulfillment, physical barcodes are vital for fast inventory check-in, error-free order picking, and automated checkout scanning. WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace includes a built-in barcode engine that generates crisp vector barcodes for every product and variation, allowing vendors to print thermal label sheets directly from the seller panel.</p><p>This guide covers supported barcode formats, assigning barcodes to simple and variable products, batch PDF printing for thermal label printers, and staff permissions.</p><hr><h2 id="supported-barcode-formats" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#supported-barcode-formats"><span>Supported Barcode Formats</span></a></h2><p>The marketplace engine supports three standard retail barcode symbologies:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Format</th><th>Symbology Standard</th><th>Typical Use Case &amp; Character Set</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Code 128</strong></td><td>High-density 1D barcode</td><td>Alphanumeric (letters, numbers, spaces, and punctuation). Standard for e-commerce packing slips, internal SKU tracking, and warehouse shelf bin locations.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>EAN-13</strong></td><td>International Article Number</td><td>13-digit numeric standard used on retail consumer products worldwide outside North America.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>UPC-A</strong></td><td>Universal Product Code</td><td>12-digit numeric standard used for retail point-of-sale in North America (USA and Canada).</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="generating-barcodes-on-products" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#generating-barcodes-on-products"><span>Generating Barcodes on Products</span></a></h2><p>Vendors can assign barcodes to individual products or generate them in bulk across the catalog.</p><h3 id="_1-generating-a-barcode-on-single-products" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-generating-a-barcode-on-single-products"><span>1. Generating a Barcode on Single Products</span></a></h3><ol><li>Open any product for editing under <strong>Catalog &gt; Products</strong> (<code>/seller/vendor-products/</code>).</li><li>Navigate to the <strong>Inventory</strong> tab (or <strong>Edit</strong> section depending on your form layout).</li><li>In the <strong>GTIN, UPC, EAN, or ISBN</strong> field, enter your numeric or alphanumeric identifier: <ul><li>For retail items, enter the manufacturer-assigned GTIN, UPC-A, or EAN-13 number.</li><li>For custom or internal items, enter a custom unique SKU or code.</li></ul></li><li>Click <strong>Save Product</strong> (or <strong>Submit for Approval</strong>).</li><li>The system automatically creates and renders the crisp vector barcode graphic below the field.</li></ol><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="text"><pre><code><span class="line">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐</span>\n<span class="line">│ GTIN, UPC, EAN, or ISBN: [ 8901234567890                  ] │</span>\n<span class="line">│                                                             │</span>\n<span class="line">│   || | |||| || ||||| ||| |||| | ||||| || ||| |||| ||        │</span>\n<span class="line">│                     8901234567890                           │</span>\n<span class="line">│   [ Download PNG ]                                          │</span>\n<span class="line">└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><ol start="6"><li>Click <strong>Download PNG</strong> to save the standalone high-resolution barcode image for product packaging, hangtags, or catalog design.</li></ol><hr><h3 id="_2-barcodes-for-variable-products" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-barcodes-for-variable-products"><span>2. Barcodes for Variable Products</span></a></h3><p>For products with multiple variations (e.g., sizes or colors):</p><ul><li>Open the <strong>Variations</strong> tab in the product editor.</li><li>Each variation contains its own unique <strong>GTIN / Barcode</strong> input field.</li><li>Vendors can assign distinct barcode numbers to each variation item (e.g., <em>Small/Red</em>, <em>Medium/Red</em>, <em>Large/Blue</em>).</li><li>On the main <strong>Products</strong> list table, click <strong>Show variations</strong> in the Barcode column to view and download barcodes for every variation individually.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="batch-barcode-generation-printing" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#batch-barcode-generation-printing"><span>Batch Barcode Generation &amp; Printing</span></a></h2><p>High-volume merchants can generate and print barcode labels for dozens of items simultaneously:</p><p>Navigate to: <strong>Catalog &gt; Products</strong> (<code>/seller/vendor-products/</code>)</p><div class="stepper-progress" style="margin:20px 0 28px 0;"><div class="stepper-step stepper-step--active"><div class="stepper-step__num">1</div><div class="stepper-step__text"><span class="stepper-step__sub">Step 1</span><span class="stepper-step__title">Select Items</span></div></div><div class="stepper-divider"></div><div class="stepper-step stepper-step--active"><div class="stepper-step__num">2</div><div class="stepper-step__text"><span class="stepper-step__sub">Step 2</span><span class="stepper-step__title">Choose Action</span></div></div><div class="stepper-divider"></div><div class="stepper-step stepper-step--active"><div class="stepper-step__num">3</div><div class="stepper-step__text"><span class="stepper-step__sub">Step 3</span><span class="stepper-step__title">Generate PDF</span></div></div><div class="stepper-divider"></div><div class="stepper-step stepper-step--active"><div class="stepper-step__num">4</div><div class="stepper-step__text"><span class="stepper-step__sub">Step 4</span><span class="stepper-step__title">Print Labels</span></div></div></div><h3 id="_1-bulk-barcode-generation" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-bulk-barcode-generation"><span>1. Bulk Barcode Generation</span></a></h3><ol><li>Select the products you want to generate barcodes for using the checkboxes in the first column.</li><li>Open the <strong>Bulk Actions</strong> menu and select <strong>Generate Barcode</strong>.</li><li>Choose the target symbology: <strong>Code 128</strong>, <strong>EAN-13</strong>, or <strong>UPC-A</strong>.</li><li>Click <strong>Apply</strong>. The engine generates and associates vector barcodes across all selected items.</li></ol><hr><h3 id="_2-printing-barcode-label-sheets-pdf" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-printing-barcode-label-sheets-pdf"><span>2. Printing Barcode Label Sheets (PDF)</span></a></h3><ol><li>Select the checkboxes of the products or variations requiring physical labels.</li><li>In the <strong>Bulk Actions</strong> dropdown menu, select <strong>Print Barcodes</strong> and click <strong>Apply</strong>.</li><li>A formatted PDF document generates immediately in a new browser tab containing: <ul><li><strong>Store Name:</strong> Identifies the merchant / vendor.</li><li><strong>Product Title:</strong> Complete item name and selected variation attributes (e.g., <em>German Premium Roast - 500g</em>).</li><li><strong>Retail Price:</strong> Formatted price in the store currency.</li><li><strong>Vector Barcode Graphic:</strong> High-contrast scannable lines rendered at 300 DPI.</li><li><strong>Alphanumeric Code:</strong> Human-readable text beneath the bars.</li></ul></li><li>Send the document directly to your thermal barcode printer (e.g., <em>Zebra</em>, <em>Rollo</em>, <em>DYMO</em>) or standard adhesive Avery label sheets.</li></ol><hr><h2 id="filtering-the-catalog-by-barcode" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#filtering-the-catalog-by-barcode"><span>Filtering the Catalog by Barcode</span></a></h2><p>Vendors can find specific products instantly using physical handheld barcode scanners:</p><ol><li>On the <strong>Products</strong> catalog screen, click the <strong>Filter</strong> button to open the filter drawer.</li><li>Place the cursor in the <strong>Barcode / GTIN</strong> filter field.</li><li>Scan the physical product label using any USB or Bluetooth barcode scanner (or type the code).</li><li>Click <strong>Apply Filters</strong>. The catalog table updates immediately to display the exact matching item.</li></ol><hr><h2 id="staff-permissions-barcode-access-control" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#staff-permissions-barcode-access-control"><span>Staff Permissions &amp; Barcode Access Control</span></a></h2><p>Store owners who employ team members can control who is authorized to view, generate, and print barcodes:</p><ul><li>Navigate to: <strong>Vendor Staff &gt; Permissions</strong></li><li>Toggle the <strong>Print Barcodes</strong> permission: <ul><li><strong>Enabled:</strong> Staff members can generate barcode graphics and print label sheets during warehouse packing workflows.</li><li><strong>Disabled:</strong> Hides barcode download and bulk printing tools from the staff member&#39;s interface.</li></ul></li></ul>',36)]))}]]),o=JSON.parse('{"path":"/documentation/product-barcode.html","title":"Product Barcode Generation & Printing Guide – WooCommerce Marketplace","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{"title":"Product Barcode Generation & Printing Guide – WooCommerce Marketplace","description":"Complete user guide on generating vector barcodes, assigning GTIN/UPC/EAN codes, printing formatted PDF barcode labels, and managing barcode access in WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace.","keywords":["woocommerce marketplace barcode","vendor print barcode labels woocommerce","gtin ean upc barcode woocommerce","code 128 barcode generator","bulk print barcode labels pdf","thermal barcode printer woocommerce"]},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"Supported Barcode Formats","slug":"supported-barcode-formats","link":"#supported-barcode-formats","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Generating Barcodes on Products","slug":"generating-barcodes-on-products","link":"#generating-barcodes-on-products","children":[{"level":3,"title":"1. Generating a Barcode on Single Products","slug":"_1-generating-a-barcode-on-single-products","link":"#_1-generating-a-barcode-on-single-products","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"2. Barcodes for Variable Products","slug":"_2-barcodes-for-variable-products","link":"#_2-barcodes-for-variable-products","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Batch Barcode Generation & Printing","slug":"batch-barcode-generation-printing","link":"#batch-barcode-generation-printing","children":[{"level":3,"title":"1. Bulk Barcode Generation","slug":"_1-bulk-barcode-generation","link":"#_1-bulk-barcode-generation","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"2. Printing Barcode Label Sheets (PDF)","slug":"_2-printing-barcode-label-sheets-pdf","link":"#_2-printing-barcode-label-sheets-pdf","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Filtering the Catalog by Barcode","slug":"filtering-the-catalog-by-barcode","link":"#filtering-the-catalog-by-barcode","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Staff Permissions & Barcode Access Control","slug":"staff-permissions-barcode-access-control","link":"#staff-permissions-barcode-access-control","children":[]}],"git":{},"filePathRelative":"documentation/product-barcode.md"}')}}]);